  "kv6.3:2.5": "dukkhasaccaṃ asaṅkhatanti. ",
  "kv6.3:2.6": "āmantā. ",
  "kv6.3:2.7": "kāyikaṃ dukkhaṃ cetasikaṃ dukkhaṃ sokaparidevadukkhadomanassupāyāsā asaṅkhatāti. ",
