  "kv6.3:6.4": "nanu vuttaṃ bhagavatā ",
  "kv6.3:6.5": "cattārimāni bhikkhave tathāni avitathāni anaññathāni. ",
  "kv6.3:6.6": "katamāni cattāri. ",
  "kv6.3:6.7": "idaṃ dukkhanti bhikkhave tathametaṃ avitathametaṃ anaññathametaṃ …pe… ",
  "kv6.3:6.8": "ayaṃ dukkhasamudayoti …pe… ",
  "kv6.3:6.9": "ayaṃ dukkhanirodhoti …pe… ",
  "kv6.3:6.10": "ayaṃ dukkhanirodhagāminī paṭipadāti tathametaṃ avitathametaṃ anaññathametaṃ ",
  "kv6.3:6.11": "imāni kho bhikkhave cattāri tathāni avitathāni anaññathānīti ",
  "kv6.3:6.12": "attheva suttantoti. ",
  "kv6.3:6.13": "āmantā. ",
  "kv6.3:6.14": "tena hi cattāri saccāni asaṅkhatānīti. ",
  "kv6.3:6.15": "saccakathā. "
